WEBVTT

00:13:29.513 --> 00:13:31.932
to understand the world
that they're growing up in

00:13:31.974 --> 00:13:35.727
and to have a conversation with them
about the role that they might play in it.

00:13:37.229 --> 00:13:39.064
Someone's going to connect these dots.

00:13:39.481 --> 00:13:41.191
The question is:

00:13:41.233 --> 00:13:43.527
Who is going to be our modern-day Hassan?

00:13:44.319 --> 00:13:48.782
And will the games of tomorrow
be games of subjugation and domination?

00:13:49.491 --> 00:13:52.119
Or inspiration and liberation.

00:13:53.453 --> 00:13:54.997
It's really up to us.

00:13:55.414 --> 00:13:56.582
Thank you.

00:13:56.582 --> 00:14:01.128
(Applause)